# Forge scratch the deploy tool writes into a record's out dir when it is run inside a record folder.
# Never commit it: cache/ may hold the RPC URL with an API key. `fhevm-npm check deployments` also
# fails while any of it is on disk, because running the tool inside a record is the mistake itself.
build/
broadcast/
cache/
.foundry/
pass2.json

# A record's out dir IS the record: the root .gitignore ignores every `out/` (build output), which silently
# dropped the seal, journal and event.json of a record whose config says `"outDir": "out"`, the name UPGRADE.md
# uses. Re-included here; the scratch above stays ignored inside it.
!out/
